{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zYc1UoZteC1795072845.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中俄美元首歷史性會晤前，美國總統特朗普與俄羅斯總統普京先舉行雙邊會談。</p><p></p><p>美國總統特朗普說︰「他是誰？是我的朋友。」</p><p></p><p>特朗普表示，他與普京都非常期待這次會面，又強調他們多年來關係都很好，彼此互相了解，有很多美妙的事情將會發生。兩人會面歷時約40分鐘。</p><p></p><p>今次是時隔15個月，兩人首次面對面接觸，特朗普去年8月在阿拉斯加與普京舉行峰會。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:14:06.756891+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T12:37:15.138486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T08:07:23.320719+00:00","content_hash":"1ea80403e9f818e19bc1a589e2eaf4a083b88cf4cf5ff7b0dc38747a966f9c07","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:14:06.756891+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}